    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2056812382715035952",
      "url": "https://x.com/narkokek/status/2056812382715035952",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/narkokek/status/2056812382715035952",
      "text": "Most people only think of @MeteoraAG as the protocol for LPing.\n\nBut over the past year, the ecosystem has grown into something way bigger.\n\nMeteora isn't just about liquidity pools, but it's quickly becoming a key piece of @solana DeFi.\n\nHere's the full breakdown:\n\n1. @MeteoraAG: The central hub\n\nThe main account where you hear about all the major product releases and announcements from the team.\n\nJust last week, the team shipped Limit Orders and Quote Token Fees. If you want more alpha, this is the channel.\n\n2. @met_lparmy: The community backbone\n\nOver 20,000 retail market makers pushing LPing into every corner of the world. These are the power users of Meteora, giving out education for FREE and pushing each other to grow every single day. Led by @Heavymetalcook6, @AlekssRG and @memecoinassasin.\n\nThe LP Army also has a global presence with regional units across France, Spain, Indonesia, Nigeria, Malaysia, Philippines and many more, all coordinated, all shipping with the goal of pushing Meteora on every corner of the world.\n\n3. @MeteoraEco: The capital markets layer.\n\nIRL events, hackathons, spaces, you name it. Meteora Ecosystem is where all the builders and founders come together to push the boundaries of capital markets together, with strong presence in recent IRL activations like MtnDAO and Solana Skyline. Led by @vesper792.\n\n4. @MeteoraInside: The investor relations arm. \n\nFull transparent on-chain data at https://t.co/b74ftqafrI, and public metrics that you can see. Meteora is one of the few protocols to score a perfect 40/40 on the Blockworks Token Transparency Filing. Led by @pranave.\n\n5. @BedrockFndn: the venture arm for tokenized startups. \n\n@0xSoju said it best: there are going to be millions of founders and startups, and every one of them will need funding. \n\nBedrock recently completed its first raise.\n\nBedrock is the bridge connecting crypto capital to the next wave of founders.\n\nMeteora started off as the liquidity layer, but now is expanding into the full infrastructure for all things capital markets on Solana, layer by layer.\n\nMeteora is not just a DEX, but an ecosystem.\n\nIf you're not bullish on Meteora yet, you need to start paying more attention.",
